A recognized header (after a terminated banner) with no SQL body at all
keeps header-only diagnostics and reports nothing about the comment
(feature.diagnostics_pipeline A18). The header is clean: `False` is
accepted by nullasblank_value because true/false match without regard to
case, so the result is empty.
-- input.ds --
/* query pending review */
:DSN := DATABASE;
:NULLASBLANK := False;
:PARAMETERS sBatch := "";
-- format --
/* query pending review */
:DSN := DATABASE;
:NULLASBLANK := False;
:PARAMETERS sBatch := "";
-- diagnostics --
-- diagnostics [--strict --info] --
